\block{Conclusions}{
\begin{enumerate}
\item The lab's framework replicates; pairing signs must be compared at equal size.
\item No general drift toward uniform pairing; errors are model- and region-specific.
\item Signature ingredients are kept; variety, distinctive pairings and category fingerprints are weakened.
\item Feedback (critique-and-revise) steers better than selection (best-of-N).
\end{enumerate}
{\small\color{muted} Scope: << D.recipes_per_region >> recipes per model and region; <% for k in F.model_order if F.models[k].data and not F.models[k].complete %><< F.models[k].name|tex >>: << F.models[k].data.regions >> regions.<% endfor %>}\\[0.2em]
\textbf{Next steps:} a scale study with Qwen3.5-4B, more model families, and human taste tests.}


